{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2023-05-11 04:46:00', 'title': 'IFS AND LOCKHEED MARTIN SIGN ENHANCED PARTNERSHIP TO KEEP AEROSPACE AND DEFENSE ASSETS MISSION-READY', 'text': 'PARTNERSHIP FOCUSES ON TURNING DATA INTO ACTIONABLE INFORMATION FOR AEROSPACE AND DEFENSE PLATFORMS LONDON , MAY 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, IFS, THE GLOBAL CLOUD ENTERPRISE APPLICATIONS PROVIDER, AND LOCKHEED MARTIN ANNOUNCED A JOINT PARTNERSHIP TO PROMOTE PRODUCTS AND SERVICES TO HELP AEROSPACE AND DEFENSE ORGANIZATIONS MAXIMIZE THE VALUE OF THEIR ENTERPRISE SOFTWARE INVESTMENTS, MODERNIZE THEIR EQUIPMENT MAINTENANCE AND SUPPORT PROCESSES, AND KEEP ASSETS MISSION-READY. IFS AND LOCKHEED MARTIN HAVE WORKED TOGETHER FOR A NUMBER OF YEARS.'}